Returns true if this type implements the specified generic interface.


Examples:

bool result1 = this.GetType().ImplementsGenericInterface(typeof(IDictionary<,>);
bool result2 = typeof(System.Collections.Generic.List<int>).ImplementsGenericInterface(typeof(IList<>);

Returns true if this type implements the specified generic interface.


Examples:

bool result1 = this.GetType().GetTypeInfo().ImplementsGenericInterface(typeof(IDictionary<,>);
bool result2 = typeof(System.Collections.Generic.List<int>).GetTypeInfo().ImplementsGenericInterface(typeof(IList<>);
